      heading: 'AI investigates while you sleep'
      descriptionPoints: '<p>As soon as it fails, an AI agent looks for the cause on the server.</p><ul><li>Probable cause, immediate actions and advice in a clear report</li><li>Ticket created in Odoo and a summary email, without touching your data</li></ul>'
